OL,3,GNEWSAA38 re-opens after multi-vehicle
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a major road has re-opened
OL,7,Fafter a multi-vehicle collision, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to the incident on the road near
OL,12,FSouth Brent, Devon at 08:10 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe road re-opened at 10:25, with
OL,16,Fpolice saying congestion in the area
OL,17,Fwas starting to ease.
OL,19,FPolice said minor injuries were
OL,20,Freported.
